{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/samana-waves-jvc","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":498,"crm_id":"122","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Samana Waves 2","slug":"samana-waves-jvc","display_address":"Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC)","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"2026","developer":"Samana Developers","price":1706650,"display_price":"","lattitude":25.0503143,"longitude":55.1962301,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":"0","about":"<p>Waves 2 is a premium multi-apartment residential complex from developer Samana Developers. This 27-storey building, designed in a modern architectural style, is located in the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/jumeirah-village-circle/\">Jumeirah Village Circle</a> area.</p><p>The complex includes studios, apartments with <strong>1-3 bedrooms and 2-bedroom duplexes</strong>. The apartment layouts have separate bedrooms, bathrooms, a living room, an open kitchen and a balcony. The duplexes have private pools. The interiors of residential buildings are designed in a luxurious style with gilded details, unique decorative items, a rich color palette and marble coverings.</p><p>Premium facilities are provided for residents of Wales 2: an indoor gym with modern equipment and an outdoor training area, a large swimming pool, sauna and steam room, concierge services. The child-friendly policy allows you to stay with children on the territory of the premium complex and provides special facilities for them, including a playground and a shallow pool for children.<br>Residents of Wales 2 have easy access to the main attractions of the city: the Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed highway runs nearby, connecting to the rest of the city, the Mall of the Emirates is a 16-minute drive, Palm Jumeirah is a 25-minute drive, Al Maktoum International Airport is a 30-minute drive.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/122/images/2023/6/12/aUvuJOysaGBBdWgvzZ3cRngsmqNi9ht3tH0n7rFM.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/6/12/aUvuJOysaGBBdWgvzZ3cRngsmqNi9ht3tH0n7rFM.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/122/images/2023/6/12/pevTMRYAz9bw5J8g0WqwGqaaMCWiI0TXLs7fhcCz.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/6/12/pevTMRYAz9bw5J8g0WqwGqaaMCWiI0TXLs7fhcCz.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/122/images/2023/6/12/RRHQ56bxJbwkoKLqzQi2H5ppQLq7nqoJpLZ1AOBL.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/6/12/RRHQ56bxJbwkoKLqzQi2H5ppQLq7nqoJpLZ1AOBL.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":1975,"url":"","file":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Samana_Waves_Brochure_07646064ca.pdf","hash":"Samana_Waves_Brochure_07646064ca","name":"Samana-Waves-Brochure.pdf"},"item":[],"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/General_Brochure_90d7160d65.png","hash":"General_Brochure_90d7160d65","name":"General"}},"video_module":{"id":1227,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[],"payment_plan_text":"75/25","payment_plans":[{"id":6105,"title":"20%","description":"Down payment"},{"id":6106,"title":"55%","description":"During construction"},{"id":6107,"title":"25%","description":"Post handover"}],"community":"Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC)","publish":1,"currency":"","amenities":[{"id":10123,"url":null,"text":"Covered Parking","type":null,"image":null},{"id":10124,"url":null,"text":"Security and CCTV","type":null,"image":null},{"id":10125,"url":null,"text":"Accessibility for people with disabilities","type":null,"image":null},{"id":10126,"url":null